%% Developer Tooling Architecture
graph TD
    subgraph DevTools["SJCCC Developer Tooling & Console Infrastructure"]
        Log["Logger (src/core/logger/)<br/>• Structured Levels (DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR, SUCCESS)<br/>• Scoped Namespaces<br/>• Production Silencing<br/>• Sensitive Key Redaction"]
